This is the code companion to the [Parking Lot System Design](./lld-parking-lot-system) post. We implement the core classes (`ParkingLot`, `ParkingSpot`, `Ticket`) in Java, apply the **Singleton**, **Factory**, and **Strategy** patterns, and use a Min-Heap to find the nearest available spot in O(log n).

---

